      "options": {
        "note": "DISCOVERY. Public company careers pages only. Each entry is one of: { name, ats: 'greenhouse'|'lever'|'workday', slug/host/tenant/site } (delegates to the official API adapter), { name, careersUrl } (scrape public job links), or { name, sitemap } (read a public sitemap.xml). Blocked pages (401/403/429/CAPTCHA/login) are logged and skipped \u2014 never bypassed."
